.TH SPP-xdb-query 1 "November 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
spp-xdb-query \- Execute a SQL, XPath, XQuery 3.1, or XQUF query on the XML database
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php xdb:query
\fI"<query_string>"\fR [\fB\-\-type\fR=\fIsql|xpath|xquery|xquf\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBxdb:query\fR executes SQL queries, XPath selections, native W3C XQuery 3.1 FLWOR expressions, and XQuery Update Facility (XQUF) mutations against SPP XDB storage.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-type= type
Specify the query execution dialect: \fBsql\fR (default), \fBxpath\fR, \fBxquery\fR, or \fBxquf\fR.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output result sets or execution responses formatted as JSON.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Instantiates \fBSPP_XDB\fR and routes query strings to the appropriate processing subsystem (\fBXMLEngine\fR, \fBXQueryEngine\fR, or \fBXQUFEngine\fR). Writes transactional mutations to the MVCC Write-Ahead Log (\fB_wal.jsonl\fR).
